# Accepted ADRs and the hash of the sections that may not change.
#
# One line per record: <id> accepted=<date> sha256=<hex over ## Context and
# ## Decision, whitespace-folded>. Written by
# the adr-management skill's check_adr_immutability.py --accept.
# Never edit this file by hand.
#
# A line here is what freezes a record. Removing one unfreezes it, deliberately
# and visibly; changing one re-blesses a record that changed, which is what
# --force is for and what a reviewer should ask about.
